  "body": "Enjoy the freedom of easy, low-maintenance living! This beautifully designed, brand-new single-level home in Strathmill, Orewa, combines modern style, comfort and everyday convenience. With high ceilings, light-filled living spaces and a practical layout, it's the perfect place to call home. Whether you're starting out, downsizing or investing, this is an opportunity to enjoy more of life with less upkeep.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Master bedroom featuring a walk-in wardrobe\r\n•  Single-level layout with no stairs for effortless everyday living\r\n•  High ceilings creating a bright, airy and spacious feel\r\n•  Open-plan living and dining, perfect for relaxing and entertaining\r\n•  Modern kitchen with generous storage and practical workspace\r\n•  Single internal-access garage plus one off-street parking space\r\n•  Quality finishes throughout\r\n•  Pre-wiring for future EV charger installation\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n•  Handy to Orewa Beach, schools, parks, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
